"You can get to the Tool Tool from the image-menu through : "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Zoom</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>,"
msgstr "Du kan komma åt zoomverktyget från bildmenyn via: <menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guisubmenu>Zoom</guisubmenu></menuchoice>,"

