#. It doesn't matter what you translate it to: it's not used at all.
#: src/toolbox/tool-measure.xml:36(None)
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-measure.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-measure.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

