msgstr "Fylla en mjukkantad markering"

#: src/toolbox/tool-bucket-fill.xml:352(para)
msgid ""
"By clicking repeatedly in a selection with feathered edges, you "
"progressively fill the feathered border:"
msgstr "Genom att klicka upprepade gånger i en markering med mjuka kanter fyller du gradvis den mjuka kanten:"

#: src/toolbox/tool-bucket-fill.xml:357(title)
